#####################################################################
# Editorial AAT verification status (v1.1)
#####################################################################
# Concepts with bzfdb:aat_match_status = "verified": 2
#   :military          -> aat:300055314 (wars)
#   :pt-fortification  -> aat:300164060 (military installations)
#
# Concepts with bzfdb:aat_match_status = "pending": ~25
#   These carry bzfdb:aat_search_term hints. Editorial Board to verify
#   via Getty AAT online (https://www.getty.edu/research/tools/vocabularies/aat/)
#   and PR with verified skos:closeMatch links.
#
# All other concepts: bzfdb:aat_match_status defaults to "pending" with no
# search term. Lower priority for verification.
